        skos:definition        "Quantification of low concentrations of oxidised nitrogen species as described in Garside, C (1982) A chemiluminescent technique for the determination of nanomolar concentrations of nitrate and nitrite in seawater. Marine Chemistry, 11, 159-167."@en;
